*
!*.md
!LICENSE
!skills/
!templates/
!templates/**
# This repo's own hook (dogfooding). .claude/agent-skills/ is a session
# clone of addyosmani/agent-skills and stays ignored. Re-ignore .md files
# directly under .claude/ - the global !*.md above would otherwise unignore
# any stray one (e.g. a reverted dogfooding skip regenerating CLAUDE.md).
!.claude/
.claude/*.md
!.claude/settings.json
# Allowlist each native skill dir explicitly (not a blanket !skills/**).
# When consumed as a .claude subtree, a blanket unignore here would also
# unignore session-installed skill caches the consumer repo means to ignore.
# Add two lines here for every new skill added under skills/.
